[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 85 'Paris",
    "start": 1.53,
    "end": 4.752,
    "zh": "第85课 “巴黎",
    "zh_hant": "第85課 “巴黎"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "in the Spring'.",
    "start": 4.652,
    "end": 6.173,
    "zh": "之春”",
    "zh_hant": "之春”"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 6.973,
    "end": 10.895,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "At what time of year did Ken visit Paris?",
    "start": 12.996,
    "end": 17.218,
    "zh": "肯是在一年中的什么时候去巴黎的？",
    "zh_hant": "肯是在一年中的什麼時候去巴黎的？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Hello, Ken.",
    "start": 19.54,
    "end": 21.14,
    "zh": "你好，肯。",
    "zh_hant": "你好，肯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Hi, George.",
    "start": 21.681,
    "end": 22.861,
    "zh": "嗨，乔治。",
    "zh_hant": "嗨，喬治。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Have you just been to the cinema?",
    "start": 23.762,
    "end": 26.143,
    "zh": "你刚去过电影院吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你剛去過電影院嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "Yes, I have.",
    "start": 26.903,
    "end": 28.564,
    "zh": "是的，我去过了。",
    "zh_hant": "是的，我去過了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "What's on?",
    "start": 29.344,
    "end": 30.485,
    "zh": "在演什么？",
    "zh_hant": "在演什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "'Paris in the Spring'.",
    "start": 30.135,
    "end": 33.366,
    "zh": "《巴黎之春》。",
    "zh_hant": "《巴黎之春》。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "Oh, I've already seen it.",
    "start": 34.267,
    "end": 37.068,
    "zh": "哦，我已经看过了。",
    "zh_hant": "哦，我已經看過了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "I saw it on television last year.",
    "start": 37.549,
    "end": 40.59,
    "zh": "我去年在电视上看过。",
    "zh_hant": "我去年在電視上看過。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "It's an old film, but it's very good.",
    "start": 41.29,
    "end": 44.792,
    "zh": "这是一部老电影，但非常好。",
    "zh_hant": "這是一部老電影，但非常好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "Paris is a beautiful city.",
    "start": 45.833,
    "end": 48.535,
    "zh": "巴黎是一座美丽的城市。",
    "zh_hant": "巴黎是一座美麗的城市。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "I've never been there.",
    "start": 49.495,
    "end": 51.176,
    "zh": "我从未去过那里。",
    "zh_hant": "我從未去過那裡。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Have you ever been there, Ken?",
    "start": 51.657,
    "end": 53.778,
    "zh": "你去过那里吗，肯？",
    "zh_hant": "你去過那裡嗎，肯？"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "Yes, I have.",
    "start": 54.619,
    "end": 56.459,
    "zh": "是的，我去过。",
    "zh_hant": "是的，我去過。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "I was there in April.",
    "start": 56.94,
    "end": 59.321,
    "zh": "我四月在那里。",
    "zh_hant": "我四月在那裡。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Paris in the spring, eh?",
    "start": 60.402,
    "end": 62.723,
    "zh": "巴黎之春，嗯？",
    "zh_hant": "巴黎之春，嗯？"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "It was spring, but the weather was awful.",
    "start": 63.804,
    "end": 67.906,
    "zh": "是春天，但天气很糟糕。",
    "zh_hant": "是春天，但天氣很糟糕。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "It rained all the time.",
    "start": 68.287,
    "end": 70.828,
    "zh": "一直在下雨。",
    "zh_hant": "一直在下雨。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "Just like London!",
    "start": 71.729,
    "end": 73.79,
    "zh": "就像伦敦一样！",
    "zh_hant": "就像倫敦一樣！"
  }
]
